title: "SCART-spatial-2026: analysis code for spatially fractionated radiotherapy spatial transcriptomics"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code reproducing the figures and tables of a spatial transcriptomic
  study of spatially fractionated radiotherapy (SCART) versus uniform-dose SBRT
  in murine H22 hepatocellular carcinoma, profiled with SeekGene SeekSpace.
